      "writtenOn": "2021-11-16T22:48:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003c\u003cSo, really, you can always make a sk_sp from a bare pointer.\u003e\u003e\n\nThat answers my concerns, I hadn\u0027t considered that difference. Thank you!",
      "parentUuid": "208ea3dd_7d035e1a",
      "revId": "48a2ea10279fb5008176cc21cb572b5098c91100",
